307 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 61 0 R
/E (TheCollege Course Registration System demonstrates the practical application of Data Structures and Algorithms to simplify the course registration process. HashMap enables fast data retrieval, Linked List manages registered courses, Queue processes registration requests in order, and Graph handles course prerequisites. The system reduces manual effort, improves data organization, and makes registration more efficient and reliable. In the future, it can be enhanced with database integration, online registration, automated waiting lists, and real-time course updates. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
